From 14d9defd1ba6513f3b97e91d4e1561985c8dc4cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:32:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] fix(interactions): show a full store as such, with the
 service's sentence

The service now reports clio_core_writes_refused among a conversation's
interaction degradations while refused writes hold its work. Every clio_core_
reason was shown as "A saved session has a damaged data record" under "Some
responses could not be read", which says the wrong thing about a full store.
That reason now shows the service's own sentence (store full, disk low) under
"Nothing new can be recorded".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BHQAws7LSR8fWEJvjbJM4q
